  "_readme": "An equivalency is a unit system a recipe can ask for as '~name x N' (a recipe line is paid by ANY mix of members worth N units). Each member is an item (item) or a tag (tag: every item of the tag counts, so the player chooses a colour or a material) and says how many units it is worth (value). The smallest member is 1. `unit` is the word shown after a count (studs, bags ...). Tags themselves are plain groups of interchangeable items (material_tags.json).",
